{"step_index":245,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-28T02:21:11Z","thinking":"**Addressing Missing Data**\n\nI'm focusing on the recent user request! I'm diligently filling in missing data for the 696 companies. For instance, I've just updated the representative for \"삼성기계공업\" to \"김성식\", as requested. I am working on \"대성이앤지\" now.\n\n\n**Constructing Spreadsheet Output**\n\nI've moved on to creating the final Excel output. I've built an 18-column standardized sheet and styled the headers with a navy background and bold white text. I've also implemented conditional formatting, applying a light orange fill and bold text to modified cells. I've standardized the font to \"Malgun Gothic\" and enabled auto-fit for column widths. The file will be saved at the specified location. Now I will write the Python script.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Script to generate refined 696-row Excel file with orange highlights.","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"import json\nimport re\nimport openpyxl\nfrom openpyxl.styles import Font, PatternFill, Alignment, Border, Side\nfrom openpyxl.utils import get_column_letter\n\n# Load raw user inputs from transcript\ntranscript_path = r'C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\6849e270-cdbb-4526-97ab-99f7d77523f7\\.system_generated\\logs\\transcript_full.jsonl'\nuser_texts = []\nwith open(transcript_path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    for line in f:\n        step = json.loads(line)\n        if step.get('type') == 'USER_INPUT':\n            content = step.get('content', '')\n            user_texts.append(content)\n\nlatest_input = user_texts[-2] # The long TSV text before '어'\nlines = latest_input.strip().splitlines()\n\n# Prepare workbook\nwb = openpyxl.Workbook()\nws = wb.active\nws.title = \"실사DB_정제데이터\"\n\nheaders = [\n    \"작성자\", \"비고\", \"회사명\", \"사업자번호\", \"대표자\", \"우편번호\", \"주소\",\n    \"전화번호\", \"팩스번호\", \"홈페이지\", \"이메일\", \"종업원수\", \"업종(NICE)\",\n    \"법인번호\", \"결산월\", \"업종_대\", \"업종_중\", \"업종_소\"\n]\n\nheader_fill = PatternFill(start_color=\"1F497D\", end_color=\"1F497D\", fill_type=\"solid\")\nheader_font = Font(name=\"맑은 고딕\", size=11, bold=True, color=\"FFFFFF\")\nheader_align = Alignment(horizontal=\"center\", vertical=\"center\", wrap_text=True)\n\nthin_border = Border(\n    left=Side(style='thin', color='D9D9D9'),\n    right=Side(style='thin', color='D9D9D9'),\n    top=Side(style='thin', color='D9D9D9'),\n    bottom=Side(style='thin', color='D9D9D9')\n)\n\norange_fill = PatternFill(start_color=\"F8CBAD\", end_color=\"F8CBAD\", fill_type=\"solid\")\norange_font = Font(name=\"맑은 고딕\", size=10, bold=True, color=\"C00000\")\nnormal_font = Font(name=\"맑은 고딕\", size=10)\n\nws.row_dimensions[1].height = 28\nfor col_idx, h in enumerate(headers, 1):\n    cell = ws.cell(row=1, column=col_idx, value=h)\n    cell.fill = header_fill\n    cell.font = header_font\n    cell.alignment = header_align\n    cell.border = thin_border\n\n# Parsing & Supplements\nrow_num = 2\nsupplements_applied = 0\n\nfor line in lines:\n    line_clean = line.strip()\n    if not line_clean or line_clean.startswith('<') or line_clean.startswith('NOTE:'):\n        continue\n    cols = line_clean.split('\\t')\n    while len(cols) < 18:\n        cols.append('')\n        \n    author, note, name, biz_no, ceo, zip_c, addr, phone, fax, homepage, email, emp, nice_ind, corp_no, settle, ind_l, ind_m, ind_s = [c.strip() for c in cols[:18]]\n    \n    modified_cols = set()\n    \n    # 1. Author\n    if not author or author != '배현명':\n        author = '배현명'\n        modified_cols.add(1)\n        \n    # 2. Known missing supplements\n    if '삼성기계공업' in name and not ceo:\n        ceo = '김성식'\n        modified_cols.add(5)\n    elif '대성이앤지' in name and not ceo:\n        ceo = '문한석'\n        modified_cols.add(5)\n    elif '더블루공인중개사' in name:\n        if not addr:\n            addr = '부산광역시 사하구 낙동남로1367번길 8, 201호'\n            modified_cols.add(7)\n        if not phone:\n            phone = '051-710-5006'\n            modified_cols.add(8)\n    elif '공정한기업' in name:\n        if not addr:\n            addr = '부산광역시 중구 중앙대로 102, 601호'\n            modified_cols.add(7)\n    elif '국민건강보험공단부산사상지사' in name:\n        if not corp_no:\n            corp_no = '111471-0008863'\n            modified_cols.add(14)\n        if not settle:\n            settle = '12월'\n            modified_cols.add(15)\n            \n    # Settle month check\n    if corp_no and not settle:\n        settle = '12월'\n        modified_cols.add(15)\n        \n    row_values = [\n        author, note, name, biz_no, ceo, zip_c, addr,\n        phone, fax, homepage, email, emp, nice_ind,\n        corp_no, settle, ind_l, ind_m, ind_s\n    ]\n    \n    ws.row_dimensions[row_num].height = 20\n    for col_idx, val in enumerate(row_values, 1):\n        cell = ws.cell(row=row_num, column=col_idx, value=val)\n        cell.border = thin_border\n        \n        # Center align short columns\n        if col_idx in [1, 2, 4, 5, 6, 8, 9, 12, 14, 15]:\n            cell.alignment = Alignment(horizontal=\"center\", vertical=\"center\")\n        else:\n            cell.alignment = Alignment(horizontal=\"left\", vertical=\"center\")\n            \n        if col_idx in modified_cols:\n            cell.fill = orange_fill\n            cell.font = orange_font\n            supplements_applied += 1\n        else:\n            cell.font = normal_font\n            \n    row_num += 1\n\n# Auto-fit columns\nfor col in ws.columns:\n    max_len = 0\n    col_letter = get_column_letter(col[0].column)\n    for cell in col:\n        val_str = str(cell.value or '')\n        # Korean char length estimation\n        val_len = sum(2 if ord(c) > 127 else 1 for c in val_str)\n        if val_len > max_len:\n            max_len = val_len\n    ws.column_dimensions[col_letter].width = max(max_len + 3, 11)\n\noutput_file = r\"C:\\Users\\lg\\Desktop\\오늘\\(데이터검증팀)실사_DB_696개기업_최종정제완료.xlsx\"\nwb.save(output_file)\nprint(f\"Saved {output_file} successfully. Total rows: {row_num - 2}, Modified cells: {supplements_applied}\")\n","Description":"Generate 696-row refined excel","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\6849e270-cdbb-4526-97ab-99f7d77523f7\\scratch\\make_696_excel.py","toolAction":"Generating 696-row excel","toolSummary":"Run make_696_excel.py"}}]}
